1
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,390
(Penny:)Hey, you guys ready to order?

2
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:07,200
Uh, sure.
Okay, Priya?

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,300
(Priya:)Uh, I'll have
the shepherd's pie.

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,530
(Priya:)You want to split
that with me?

5
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:11,330
(Leonard:)Oh, no, no, no,
he doesn't.

6
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:12,370
(Priya:)Why not?

7
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:14,540
(Leonard:)Well, you have milk in
the taters,

8
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,370
(Leonard:)milk in the gravy,
parmesan crust.

9
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:18,110
(Leonard:)Your lactose-intolerant
boyfriend will turn

10
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,510
(Leonard:)into a gas-filled
Macy's Day balloon.

11
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:25,650
(Sheldon:)Not quite accurate. The Macy's
balloons are filled with helium,

12
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,550
(Sheldon:)whereas Leonard produces copious
amounts of methane.

13
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:36,560
(Leonard:)So, no, on the shepherd's pie.
Can we move on?

14
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,560
Yeah, a little tip:
he says he can eat frozen yogurt.

15
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,930
Do not believe it.

16
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:43,730
Sea bass!
I'll have the sea bass!

17
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:45,170
(Howard:)You gotta like this,

18
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:47,330
(Howard:)the girlfriend and the
ex-girlfriend bonding

19
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:49,500
(Howard:)over your rooty-tooty
stinky booty.

20
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,370
(Leonard:)Kill me.

21
00:00:52,370 --> 00:00:55,010
It wouldn't help.
The human body is capable

22
00:00:55,010 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)of being flatulent for hours
after death.

